return {
    ["\n5月24日\n晴天。漫山的雪反射的阳光非常刺眼，为了避免眼睛遭罪，我建议尼尔等太阳落山后再外出。他没把我的话放在心上，自顾自地收拾我们的东西，然后就先走了，他总是这样。\n我把东西收拾好追上他，远远望去，他在雪地里的影子有五个，朝着五个方向走。\n可能是我看错了，再望过去，只剩一个了。\n我们在山腰的位置扎营，距离登顶应该不远了。\n\n剩余物资：\n面包4份半\n肉干和肉肠3份\n糖1罐\n黄油3块\n酒2瓶\n水5瓶 路上找到水源，进行了补充"] = "\nMay 24\nSunny. The sunlight reflected by the mountains of snow is very dazzling. To avoid hurting our eyes, I suggested Neil go out after the sun sets. He didn't take my words to heart, packed our things on his own, and left first. He is always like this.\nI packed the things and caught up with him. Looking from afar, he had five shadows in the snow, walking in five directions.\nMaybe I saw it wrong. Looking again, there was only one left.\nWe camped at the waist of the mountain, it shouldn't be far from the summit.\n\nRemaining supplies:\nBread 4.5 portions\nBeef jerky and sausages 3 portions\nSugar 1 jar\nButter 3 blocks\nWine 2 bottles\nWater 5 bottles, found a water source on the way and replenished",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>鎏金缀饰\n晨祷者的衣角沾着露水和光线，每一步踏在颂歌的尾音上，将圣殿的宁静吟诵成行走的诗篇。"] = "<DecH>Craftsmanship: </>Gilded Embellishments\nThe hem of the morning prayer's robe is stained with dew and light; every step taken on the tail end of the hymn chants the tranquility of the sanctuary into a walking poem.",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>锋锐猎装\n赤诚如新月初绽，无声的誓言比鲜血更炽热。"] = "<Highlight>Craft: </>Sharp Hunting Outfit\nAs pure as a new moon rising, the silent vow is more fervent than fresh blood.",
    ["<Highlight>序列权柄：</>\n信息、知识\n\n<Highlight>核心能力：</>\n窥探世界背后的神秘学真相，解析万物运行的隐秘规律，窥视被隐藏的秘密。可隐藏自身于知识迷雾中，但知识本身即是诅咒——知晓越多越接近疯狂。是未知领域的探索者，隐秘知识的守护者，也是代价的承担者。"] = "<Highlight> Sequence Authority: </> \n Information, Knowledge \n \n <Highlight> Core Ability: </> \n Peeks into the occult truths behind the world, analyzes the hidden laws of all things, and spies on hidden secrets. Can hide oneself in the fog of knowledge, but knowledge itself is a curse—the more one knows, the closer one is to madness. It is the explorer of unknown fields, the guardian of hidden knowledge, and the bearer of the price.",
    ["<M_Default>亲爱的非凡者：</>\n<M_Default>恭喜您在副本玩法中跻身本职业全国排名前100，特赠荣誉头衔，可前往</><HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"jump=1250011\">【菜单-角色-头衔界面】</><M_Default>使用。</>"] = "<M_Default> Dear Beyonder: </>\n<M_Default> Congratulations on ranking in the top 100 nationwide for your profession in the Dungeon mode. You have been awarded an honorary title. You can go to </><HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"jump=1250011\"> [Menu - Character - Title Interface] </><M_Default> to use it. </>",
